          "titleAfter": "Shredder Plant Sequencer",
          "commentChanged": false,
          "commentBefore": "Shredder plant sequencer (C-118-C-125): commands the shredder motor (via FB_MotorFwdRevSystem, wired at FC_ControlMain) and gates infeed/discharge conveyors and upstream enable, through a stepped cycle. Step legend (C-120): 0=Idle (stopped, waiting for a start condition) - 10=PreStart (siren warning before motion; arms the motor via MotorStartArm) - 20=DischargeStart (discharge conveyor starting, timed) - 30=ReverseRun (reverse commanded; the motor FB's own ReverseDelay entry pause elapses inside this step, then ReverseRunTimer counts ShredderReverseRunTime of CONFIRMED reverse feedback) - 40=WaitForwardRun (waiting for forward-run feedback) - 50=Running (normal production; infeed/upstream-enable timers and overcurrent detection are live) - 60=OvercurrentAbort (tripped - pause, then retry into ReverseRun, or stay out if too many reversals). Stop-all (REQ-012/013/062): StopCmd = stop button OR downstream lost OR control circuit unhealthy - aborts every step to Idle. Pusher handling is split (owner amendment 2026-07-16): stop button/unhealthy force pusher mode 0 (parks AND blocks jog), while any live stop reason - downstream loss included - raises PusherCycleInhibitCmd (no cycle launches or continues into a stopped plant, hand-jog stays available).",
          "commentAfter": "Shredder plant sequencer (C-118-C-125): commands the shredder motor (via FB_MotorFwdRevSystem, wired at FC_ControlMain) and gates infeed/discharge conveyors and upstream enable, through a stepped cycle. Step legend (C-120): 0=Idle (stopped, waiting for a start condition) - 10=PreStart (siren warning before motion; arms the motor via MotorStartArm) - 20=DischargeStart (discharge conveyor starting, timed) - 30=ReverseRun (reverse commanded; the motor FB's own ReverseDelay entry pause elapses inside this step, then ReverseRunTimer counts ShredderReverseRunTime of CONFIRMED reverse feedback) - 40=WaitForwardRun (waiting for forward-run feedback) - 50=Running (normal production; infeed/upstream-enable timers and overcurrent detection are live) - 60=OvercurrentAbort (tripped - pause, then retry into ReverseRun, or stay out if too many reversals). Stop-all (REQ-012/013/062): StopCmd = stop button OR downstream lost OR control circuit unhealthy - aborts every step to Idle. Pusher handling is split (owner amendment 2026-07-16): stop button/unhealthy force pusher mode 0 (parks AND blocks jog), while any live stop reason - downstream loss included - raises PusherCycleInhibitCmd (no cycle launches or continues into a stopped plant, hand-jog stays available).",
